load @/code/vibe/dock
  find dock

note <The knit, the law of motion, the sixth base element. Each beat it has two steps. Collide, the two tones meeting head on in each line rearrange by a fixed permutation. Then stream, each site hands its tone one dock onward to the matching site of its neighbor. The knit is the unique local reversible rule symmetric under the full symmetry of the cell, forced not chosen.>

form knit
  link dock, like dock
